        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 26 at 1:24PM EDT until September 27 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Boston/Norton MA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts between 35 and 50
mph.

* WHERE...Franklin County, Hampshire County, and Western Hampden MA.

* WHEN...Until noon EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The long duration of the winds coupled with
heavy rain and fully leafed trees may exacerbate the risk for tree
damage and power outages.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
